<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Toko Jersey Custom</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0;background:#f5f5f5}
header{background:#111;color:#fff;padding:20px;text-align:center}
nav{background:#222;padding:10px;text-align:center}
nav a{color:#fff;margin:0 15px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
.hero{background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521572163474-6864f9cf17ab') center/cover;height:350px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;text-align:center}
.hero h1{background:rgba(0,0,0,0.6);padding:20px;border-radius:10px}
.container{padding:40px}
.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{background:#fff;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)}
.card img{width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover}
.card h3{padding:10px}
.card p{padding:0 10px 15px}
.custom{background:#fff;padding:40px;border-radius:10px;margin-top:40px}
footer{background:#111;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:20px;margin-top:40px}
button{background:#000;color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:5px;cursor:pointer}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h1>Toko Jersey & Sandal Custom</h1>
<p>Jersey • Kaos • Sandal Selop • Custom Gambar</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#produk">Produk</a>
<a href="#custom">Custom Desain</a>
<a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
<h1>Buat Jersey & Kaos Custom Sesuai Desain Kamu</h1>
</section>

<div class="container" id="produk">
<h2>Produk Kami</h2>
<div class="products">

<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512436991641-6745cdb1723f">
<h3>Jersey Printing</h3>
<p>Jersey olahraga dengan desain custom full printing.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523381210434-271e8be1f52b">
<h3>Kaos Custom</h3>
<p>Kaos sablon dengan gambar sesuai keinginan.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600180758890-6b94519a8ba3">
<h3>Sandal Selop</h3>
<p>Sandal selop nyaman dengan desain logo atau gambar custom.</p>
</div>

</div>

<div class="custom" id="custom">
<h2>Pesanan Custom</h2>
<p>Kami melayani pembuatan desain sesuai gambar yang Anda kirim. Cocok untuk komunitas, tim olahraga, brand clothing, dan lainnya.</p>

<ul>
<li>Custom jersey tim</li>
<li>Custom kaos brand</li>
<li>Custom sandal selop logo</li>
</ul>

<button onclick="alert('Silakan hubungi WhatsApp untuk memesan')">Pesan Sekarang</button>
</div>

</div>

<footer id="kontak">
<h3>Kontak Pemesanan</h3>
<p>WhatsApp: 08xxxxxxxxxx</p>
<p>Instagram: @tokojerseycustom</p>
<p>© 2026 Toko Jersey Custom</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
